#: b7d7a8bd7e6f46b7b48578aa46c81518 d38a59df403b4bbf888ca5cc4d254686
msgid ""
"To allow CRSF and embedded telemetry available in Fport, CRSF, and SRXL2 "
"receivers, the RX6 pin can also be configured to be used as true UART6 RX "
"pin for use with bi-directional systems by setting the "
":ref:`BRD_ALT_CONFIG<BRD_ALT_CONFIG>` to “1” so it becomes the SERIAL6 "
"port's RX input pin."
msgstr ""
"为使用 FPort、CRSF、SRXL2 接收机中的 CRSF 和内嵌数传功能，RX6 引脚也可通过将 "
":ref:`BRD_ALT_CONFIG<BRD_ALT_CONFIG>` 设置为「1」来配置为真实 UART6 RX 引脚，供双向系统使用，成为 "
"SERIAL6 接口的 RX 输入引脚。"

