"The pin marked 9V (can be selected by jumper on the rear of the board to be "
"9V or 12V)."
msgstr "标记为 9V 的引脚（可通过板子背面的跳线选择 9V 或 12V）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-kakuteh7wing.rst:128
