#: 12d1627b734c481db3e01c690040519a 2ad88418ab364862968ecf354e21be4f
#: 77d214bb71d54576ad2b27541ef86826 8f031bf7cfed48efaa7e855a44f82bc0
msgid ""
"Switching between the two camera inputs, C1 (default on) or C2, and between "
"on (default) and off of the 9V supply pin can be implemented using the Relay"
" function of ArduPilot and assigning the relays to an ``RCx_OPTION`` switch "
"on the transmitter."
msgstr ""
"两路摄像头输入之间的切换（C1 默认开启，或 C2），以及 9V 供电引脚的开关（默认开启），可通过 ArduPilot "
"的继电器功能实现，并将继电器分配到遥控器上的 ``RCx_OPTION`` 开关。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-kakuteh7wing.rst:130
#: 0dc0c9995a594c2f924b928884d337d5 2176c3dcf0324cd8a7ce46d13781d0fd
#: 3e56f94be2934bc8a92811bb9f1f6ab8 49625689d046423e87a0e7f9a6124430
#: a8ccca32ed7842e19d3837ccd0b9164b cd256083cb664bef920e54c53b5abfb3
msgid ""
"Set the ``RELAYx_PIN`` to \"82\" for on/off of 9V supply, and to \"81\" to "
"control the camera switching. Then select an RC channel for control (Chx) "
"and set its ``RCx_OPTION`` to the appropriate Relay (1-4) that you had set "
"its pin parameter above."
msgstr ""
"将 ``RELAYx_PIN`` 设置为 「82」 以控制 9V 供电的开关，设置为 「81」 以控制摄像头切换。然后为控制通道（Chx）选择一个 RC"
" 通道，并将其 ``RCx_OPTION`` 设置为对应的继电器（1-4），该继电器的引脚参数已在上方设置。"

